s to triumph!&quot;<br><br>Will you be a Guardian, defending the precious candies scattered across different landscapes, or will you embrace the life of a Bandit set on stealing these delicious treasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.poster.avif?t=1761311881\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.webm?t=1761311881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.mp4?t=1761311881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions:</strong> Grab one of many action boxes scattered around the maps and use the unique effects to your and your teams advantage!<br>Actions vary from simple dashes to more complex team-based actions like laying bombs and blinding your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/772209f58b5d3087f5b17d50685cced3.poster.avif?t=1761311881\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/772209f58b5d3087f5b17d50685cced3.webm?t=1761311881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/772209f58b5d3087f5b17d50685cced3.mp4?t=1761311881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted world divided into distinct areas, each brought to life as a unique playable level. Navigate your choices with a specially designed, visually stunning map. Select your battleground, form your crew, and embark on epic candy heists. It's time to unite friends, break down genre boundaries, and embark on a thrilling adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sufficiently Roasted"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/header.jpg?t=1761311881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3, 2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5, 2.8GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2670810/790422/e81d0af4d0d113fa9a3e8166d2b1ba0cb56f19d3/1750941715/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732800157","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2670810/790422/e81d0af4d0d113fa9a3e8166d2b1ba0cb56f19d3/1750941715/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732800157","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2670810/790422/e81d0af4d0d113fa9a3e8166d2b1ba0cb56f19d3/1750941715/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732800157","id":257076244,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257076244/movie480.mp4?t=1732800157","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co